#: lib/const_reports.php
msgid "Notification List Recipients"
msgstr "Mottagare från aviseringslistor"

#: lib/const_reports.php
msgid "To add a Recipients based upon an valid Notification List."
msgstr "Lägg till mottagare från en giltig aviseringslista."

#: lib/const_reports.php
msgid ""
"Enable/disable automatic creation of all data items based on given "
"filters.This will be called before report execution.  Obsolete RRDs will be "
"deleted and all RRDs matching the filter settings will be added."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera eller inaktivera automatisk skapning av dataobjekt utifrån filtren."
" Det sker innan rapporten körs. Föråldrade RRD:er tas bort och alla RRD:er "
"som matchar filtren läggs till."

#: lib/const_reports.php
msgid "Reporting Period"
msgstr "Rapporteringsperiod"

#: templates.php
msgid ""
"A name like \"Threshold\" for example which should be used as a headline "
"within the report config."
msgstr ""
"Ett namn, till exempel ”Tröskel”, som ska användas som rubrik i "
"rapportkonfigurationen."
